        "Risk if Ignored",
        "Status"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "No Headless Pilot Tests",
          "High",
          "UI regressions not caught by unit tests.",
          "**Partially addressed** — 14 Pilot tests added for mount, help, refresh, provider error, quit"
